    "Id": "chassisdef_skinwalker_ii_SKW-2-A",
    "Name": "Skinwalker II",
    "Details": "The A configuration of the Skinwalker II OmniMech carries on the legacy of the Stormcrow's old primary configuration, but relies entirely on three ER Large Lasers, one in each arm and one in the center torso. Their long reach makes it a favorite of MechWarriors with good sniper skills who prefer to fight from a distance, while extra double heat sinks keep the lasers firing and a Nova CEWS shields it with electronic countermeasures.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
